191
00:09:41,331 --> 00:09:42,249
Vai!

192
00:09:42,332 --> 00:09:43,834
Tá, tá.

193
00:09:43,917 --> 00:09:46,170
É melhor se apressar e decidir.

194
00:09:47,004 --> 00:09:47,921
Tá, tá.

195
00:09:50,716 --> 00:09:51,049
Manny-

196
00:09:51,133 --> 00:09:54,595
